:: dialog/example/gate-warden [dialog example]
The old gate warden doesn't look up from the ledger.
"Nobody crosses. Not since the sealing."

[[Ask about the sealing->dialog/example/sealing]]
[[Show the lab keycard->dialog/example/keycard]]
[[Leave->dialog/example/leave]]

:: dialog/example/sealing [dialog example]
"The alarm did its job. Everyone ran.
Everyone who could hear it, anyway."

He finally looks at you.
"You slept through it, didn't you."

[[Show the lab keycard->dialog/example/keycard]]
[[Leave->dialog/example/leave]]

:: dialog/example/keycard [dialog example]
He turns the keycard over twice.
"Clearance circle. Then you already know
more than I'm allowed to say."

:: dialog/example/leave [dialog example]
He goes back to the ledger.
The pen hasn't had ink in weeks.
